# A collection is a dcat:Catalog (not redeclared here). It holds source
# records (sti:inCollection points to it), states their claims
# (sti:claimedBy points to it), owns the vocabulary those claims use, and
# holds the SSSOM mappings it issued for that vocabulary (mapping.ttl).
# Standard terms it uses: 
#------------Literal fields-----------------------
# dcterms:title
# dcterms:issued
# dcterms:modified
# dcterms:description
# dcat:keyword
# dct:alternative
# foaf:homepage
#-----------Connections---------------------------
# dcterms:publisher => foaf:Agent
# dcat:contactPoint => vCard:Kind
# dcterms:spatial => dct:Location
# dcterms:license => <dcterms:LicenseDocument>
# sssom:mappings => owl:Axiom (an SSSOM mapping; accepted or rejected only)
